{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "c44f0f6f85ba02b3bd8f8860cc4352e0c3cca2fe1199de2d7f23fac63a29d97e", "ja": "ホンモノトニセモノ", "zh": "真品与赝品", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b377a2e8592cf4c9c66fe37bef7a71d59b51b8b32dc96a530e202a61423ca66e", "ja": "静香に問われ、あずさへの特別な思いを語る\n海美。だがふたりの仲を引き裂こうと画策す\nるうち、育の昔話を聞いてしまう。あずさに\n慰められ、救われた経験は自分だけの特別な\nものではないと知り、ショックを受ける。", "zh": "海美被静香问起后，诉说了自己对あずさ的特殊感情。然而，在策划拆散两人关系的过程中，她听到了育的往事。得知自己曾被あずさ安慰、拯救的经历并不是独属于自己的特别回忆后，她受到了打击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "748fbad78983622976f6b8cf6a91b6528392ca02f092e63ad550bab49cc37287", "ja": "こうなったら……あの1年生があずさお姉さまと\n会えないように、イタズラしてやるんだから！", "zh": "既然这样……我就要恶作剧，让那个1年级生见不到梓姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "f39139e8b03598357f8a6041dea63d23f72ecb310a0a78107231093fc50d6d49", "ja": "えっと、中谷育の下駄箱は……\nあ、あれ？　どこかしら？", "zh": "那个……中谷育的鞋柜是……  \n啊，奇怪？会在哪儿呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "45c867276961b12fe4b1f1a2ec72e158616b408ec46475f0a920b3dc09e2e4b3", "ja": "あっ！　……あ、あの、高坂さん、ですよね？\nおはようございます！", "zh": "啊！……那、那个，请问您是高坂小姐，对吧？\n早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "0701ed359a053319676652814bbfa40c9440331ba725bbfc4b2c4ce8d59713f0", "ja": "きゃああああっ！！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "e31fb77601cb5566cb0960ae0e722558a83c83c9379b29070938db3e63e5450a", "ja": "まったく……信じられないったら！\nあの転校生！", "zh": "真是的……难以置信！\n那个转学生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "ad33774bb4a71eed691d7db1a1d5bb69337793cf9abce3e7cb641dddf0a1552c", "ja": "さっきのすごい悲鳴、海美だったの？　もう……\nはしたないことは控えるよう、言ったばかりなのに。", "zh": "刚才那声惊天动地的惨叫，是海美发出来的？真是的……\n我才刚说过，要注意不要做出不雅的举动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "b2df8a7d7da854c16fc1d55620da0e9c80d0b9198339058df0ccd69cc94218f3", "ja": "だ、だって！　下駄箱にオモチャのヘビを\n仕掛けようと思ったら、あの中谷育が……あっ！", "zh": "可、可是！我正想把玩具蛇放进鞋柜里，结果那个中谷育她……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "4b98053f482bcffdcc1df1691faef1b99f26dc1a48502ec2dcd35d719b1c58f2", "ja": "はぁ……海美。次のミス・ラベンダーになりたいなら、\nすこしは落ち着いて行動しなさい。", "zh": "唉……海美。如果你想成为下一任“薰衣草小姐”，\n就稍微冷静一点再行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "971694a0689174a75fd051d9bf3ff00e668e170469ccd99b0f1c722aa6743378", "ja": "けど、あの中谷育って子、今日はやけに見かけるわね。\n海美と何か話したいのかも……？", "zh": "不过，那个叫中谷育的孩子，今天好像特别常见到呢。\n说不定是想和海美聊些什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "d1621ada51d7af21871edb9f8a9090360a6947585380d826f56246c3a36b216b", "ja": "中谷育が、どうして私と？", "zh": "中谷育为什么要找我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "1bdaa8597385b4e9c60aed627ad67a52b4c9ef23208de3b56364f9fa076bd871", "ja": "わからないけど……\nやっぱり、ミス・ラベンダーのことかしら？", "zh": "虽然不太清楚……\n果然还是和薰衣草小姐有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9db74bd796782d79a75175f8f610cfa9a1405386403ece7d1765bf5c0083511", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダーからは、何か聞いてないの？", "zh": "你没从薰衣草小姐那里听说什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "873756dee909356f5bb02316caad5520d98d968893402ebafef266bf0cc47cb2", "ja": "全然。お姉さま、最近いつもあの子と話してるから……\n鉢合わせないようにすると、全然会えなくて。", "zh": "完全没听说。因为姐姐最近总是在和那个孩子说话……\n为了不和她撞见，结果完全见不到姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "22418aaba72d4f6b620f4a316a48c30d9c94e1595d157278483c6872f2ebf0da", "ja": "はっ。……もしかして、それが目的！？\n私を、お姉さまから遠ざけようとして……！", "zh": "啊……难道这才是目的！？想让姐姐离我远远的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "511408610eba40ed42d884e2f73d9d15cedcb6a17c3800a09b47a0de4cf8cbdf", "ja": "まさか。\n考えすぎだと思うけど。", "zh": "怎么可能。\n我觉得你想太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "01d15a0762d60ceee9674dd3169d0aa64d8f5c9e51675b77ed06de677c8921ae", "ja": "いいえ……きっと、そうに違いないわ！　ちゃっかり\n自分だけお姉さまとの逢瀬を楽しんで……許せない！", "zh": "不……一定就是那样没错！竟然自己\n偷偷享受着与姐姐大人的幽会……不可原谅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "f7e81df94b22bfbbe09075a9f279da28fe886705e670db7016bfe0370e1d8ff7", "ja": "はぁ……。そういえば、前から疑問だったけど。海美、\n貴女どうしてそこまでミス・ラベンダーにこだわるの？", "zh": "唉……说起来，我之前就一直觉得奇怪。海美，你为什么会如此执着于薰衣草小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "889720dea126db08c37dfe9178fd04bdb35a8fe604d73f1cbb59c4868c4fb213", "ja": "そりゃあ素敵な方だとは思うわ。思うけど……\n私のお姉さまだって、決して負けてないはずだし♪", "zh": "我当然也觉得她很出色。是觉得她很出色没错，但是……\n我的姐姐也绝对不会输给她才对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "4d5172159add136850998fcd846ae4e8133960dd5b8f8f0fe8707f6cb8d95914", "ja": "素敵とか、そういう理由じゃないわ。あずさお姉さま\nだからよ。小さいころに出会った、私の大切な人……。", "zh": "才不是因为她优秀之类的理由呢。是因为她是我的姐姐大人，梓姐姐。是我小时候遇见的重要之人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "be4559afee0e2244b1f6063b377b4caa24419857f247375ac85bb8fd38ba8913", "ja": "小さいころ……海美が転入してきたのは、10歳だった\nかしら？　次の年に、私と同じクラスになったのよね。", "zh": "小时候……海美转学过来的时候，是10岁\n来着？第二年，就和我分到了同一个班呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "04c74abd00e78f3d3f3d7f5f84ad1f88e87f33ea39196978185a07faaac4dff3", "ja": "うん。帰国子女で、この学園にうまく馴染めなくて……\n毎日のように泣いていたころ、お姉さまと出会ったの。", "zh": "嗯。我是从国外回来的孩子，一直没能很好地融入这所学校……在几乎每天都哭的那段日子里，我遇见了姐姐大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "9a01c0c5714bbda3070a2af6edd8fb5645e7b43c2a9849b084980fed2dc2fe74", "ja": "あの時、お姉さまが声をかけてくださらなかったら、\n私は今でもひとりぼっちだったかもしれない……。", "zh": "要是当时姐姐没有跟我搭话，\n我说不定直到现在都还是孤身一人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "2d41f695370f370284992116339b1a3c4b5351a8f7fa7217be824fda0ca4302b", "ja": "だから私、決めているの。あずさお姉さまのためなら、\nなんでもする！って。そう、決めたのに……。", "zh": "所以我已经决定了。只要是为了梓姐姐，\n我什么都愿意做！我明明已经这么决定了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "132df0d64874a9dc900cf8bc046fb66854449b72da9bf35a34d2946aae3e4fb9", "ja": "海美……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1026_null", "source_sha256": "c9ffd99eb302e2a7111a5358a81d857626e9a7f94e3639fecc3053a5a78e961b", "ja": "放課後、中庭……", "zh": "放学后，中庭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "a96a8450c1639cd6dc1420097507b271f369cb4a59e2cc84cad846480530003d", "ja": "あの転校生、弱点はないのかしら。\nどうにかして探りを入れたいけど……。", "zh": "那个转校生，难道就没有弱点吗？\n真想找机会打探一下啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "c120565cb7ee17354e25ffffc44f842a716478851c7a5c91b86490fd250ce793", "ja": "あっ……友達と話してる！\n情報をゲットするチャンスだわ！", "zh": "啊……她正在和朋友聊天！\n这是获取情报的机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "f13a976c23f1d859ea285ec0252049b3bcc69a953e8d8e60b884c8fcf1090a28", "ja": "もう、海美ったら……会話を盗み聞きなんて、\n品がなくてよ。……見逃すのは、今回だけですからね？", "zh": "真是的，海美也真是的……偷听别人说话，\n可太没教养了。……下不为例，仅限这次放过你哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "273d0c48c2fdd0ee6a6b1832737f078dca0bd50e4b55288cde8f21964658ed21", "ja": "ふふ。それじゃあミス・ラベンダーと育さんは、\n本当の姉妹みたいに過ごしてきたんだねぇ。", "zh": "呵呵。这么说来，薰衣草小姐和育小姐，\n一直像真正的姐妹那样一起生活过来的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "3c655e96caba48555d53f6f4006e0fcf7ba4ffd31abeeb83fe095b014a1df633", "ja": "うん♪　わたしね、今でも覚えてるんだ。\n小さくて、泣き虫だったころのこと……。", "zh": "嗯♪　我呀，到现在还记得哦。\n自己还很小、还是个爱哭鬼那时候的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "c3b46f40c9563355889fa50c6b0d3b47bfbb2c0b7a2ca13e403ee0663f7d199f", "ja": "何でもないことで泣いちゃっても、あずさお姉ちゃんは\nすぐきてくれて……優しく慰めてくれたんだ。", "zh": "就算我因为一点小事就哭出来，梓姐姐也会\n马上赶过来……温柔地安慰我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "d3c673597c95666ce1e3badec44e4648a3c7acb5e9922e15bfcce6f826fe5d0d", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダーは、学園でもみんなに優しいよぉ。\n育さんと、ずっと一緒だったからかもしれないねぇ。", "zh": "薰衣草学姐在学园里也是对谁都好温柔呢。\n说不定是因为一直和育小姐在一起呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8d82d5def735cd800953b88a8638fb00580fbd178bb0a3a85b2fc10efc905d0", "ja": "あの子と、ずっと……じゃあ、\nお姉さまが本当に優しくしたかったのは……。", "zh": "和那孩子，一直……那么，\n姐姐大人真正想要温柔以待的其实是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "9d5119b1a773803ac25c4591823b0bfb3fa7aeba7ea05a4c99eb6410f0f68d34", "ja": "私じゃなくて、あの子だった……？", "zh": "不是我，而是那个孩子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "5618984ec4e661895210e7a87eb5c404ed2b7df984e6c3baaa725b8f96fd3330", "ja": "あっ、海美！？　待って……もうっ！\n……ちょっと、そこの転校生……中谷育さん！？", "zh": "啊，海美！？等等……真是的！\n……喂，那边的转校生……中谷育同学！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "f5935778e85962dc35608703407f659f8819c5f4ccc9845fa352e9f30246b18e", "ja": "へっ！？　は、はい！", "zh": "诶！？是、是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "4e080f0f495360e5427be22dc00c30344b5007994b845f097ffd7c51b2e69742", "ja": "聞きたいことがあるの……貴女と、それから\nミス・ラベンダーにも！　至急、会わせてくださる？", "zh": "我有事想问……想问你，还有\n薰衣草小姐！能立刻让我见她吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "a000179b0f4d827396f5a09c2a5e524eb924fddcc00c188d671352fe6a7c7718", "ja": "あずさお姉ちゃん……？", "zh": "梓姐姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "819362aee6cdb9e7c08e336ed4f134a03da3026e96325d5984773562b00f523f", "ja": "私じゃなかったんだ……本物が戻ってきたから、\nお姉さまは、私が、いらなくなっちゃったんだ……。", "zh": "原来不是我……因为真正的人回来了，\n姐姐就不再需要我了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_04_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8b10e0c3fcd3459f2609f5622889dc50094a6a29a40feec3dd7dccdf392a56f", "ja": "ずっと、勘違いしてたんだ。本物は転校生のほう。\n私のほうが、ニセモノだったんだ……。", "zh": "我一直都误会了。转校生才是真正的那个人。\n原来我才是冒牌货……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
